"<main><header class="wb-onboarding-band"><div class="wb-onboarding-wrap"><p class="wb-onboarding-count" aria-live="polite">Step 1 of 3</p><h1>Tell us what you love</h1><p class="wb-onboarding-lede">We’ll use this to curate your monthly challenges.</p><div class="wb-onboarding-steps"><div class="wb-onboarding-step"><div class="wb-onboarding-step-dot" data-state="active" aria-current="step">1</div><div class="wb-onboarding-step-line" data-complete="false" aria-hidden="true"></div><span class="wb-onboarding-step-label" data-state="active">Preferences</span></div><div class="wb-onboarding-step"><div class="wb-onboarding-step-dot" data-state="upcoming">2</div><div class="wb-onboarding-step-line" data-complete="false" aria-hidden="true"></div><span class="wb-onboarding-step-label" data-state="upcoming">Profile</span></div><div class="wb-onboarding-step"><div class="wb-onboarding-step-dot" data-state="upcoming">3</div><span class="wb-onboarding-step-label" data-state="upcoming">Plan</span></div></div></div></header><div class="wb-onboarding-sheet"><div class="wb-onboarding-body"><div class="wb-onboarding-card wb-onboarding-panel"><form class="space-y-6"><fieldset class="space-y-3"><legend class="text-sm font-medium">Dietary preferences</legend><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-2 sm:grid-cols-2"><label class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-3 rounded-md border px-3 py-2 transition-colors border-input hover:bg-muted/50"><input class="size-4 rounded border-input" type="checkbox"><span class="text-sm">Vegetarian</span></label><label class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-3 rounded-md border px-3 py-2 transition-colors border-input hover:bg-muted/50"><input class="size-4 rounded border-input" type="checkbox"><span class="text-sm">Vegan</span></label><label class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-3 rounded-md border px-3 py-2 transition-colors border-input hover:bg-muted/50"><input class="size-4 rounded border-input" type="checkbox"><span class="text-sm">Gluten-Free</span></label><label class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-3 rounded-md border px-3 py-2 transition-colors border-input hover:bg-muted/50"><input class="size-4 rounded border-input" type="checkbox"><span class="text-sm">Halal</span></label><label class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-3 rounded-md border px-3 py-2 transition-colors border-input hover:bg-muted/50"><input class="size-4 rounded border-input" type="checkbox"><span class="text-sm">Kosher</span></label><label class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-3 rounded-md border px-3 py-2 transition-colors border-input hover:bg-muted/50"><input class="size-4 rounded border-input" type="checkbox"><span class="text-sm">Dairy-Free</span></label><label class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-3 rounded-md border px-3 py-2 transition-colors border-input hover:bg-muted/50"><input class="size-4 rounded border-input" type="checkbox"><span class="text-sm">Pescatarian</span></label></div></fieldset><section class="space-y-2"><div class="space-y-1"><h3 class="text-sm font-medium">Any cuisines you'd rather skip?</h3><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">Tell us what you don't enjoy and we'll never send you there. Leave blank if you're game for anything.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4"><button type="button" class="group relative flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 text-left text-sm font-medium transition-colors border-input bg-background text-foreground hover:bg-muted/50 cursor-pointer" aria-pressed="false"><span class="pr-5">American — BBQ, Burgers, Diner</span></button><button type="button" class="group relative flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 text-left text-sm font-medium transition-colors border-input bg-background text-foreground hover:bg-muted/50 cursor-pointer" aria-pressed="false"><span class="pr-5">Italian</span></button><button type="button" class="group relative flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 text-left text-sm font-medium transition-colors border-input bg-background text-foreground hover:bg-muted/50 cursor-pointer" aria-pressed="false"><span class="pr-5">Mexican</span></button><button type="button" class="group relative flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 text-left text-sm font-medium transition-colors border-input bg-background text-foreground hover:bg-muted/50 cursor-pointer" aria-pressed="false"><span class="pr-5">Chinese</span></button><button type="button" class="group relative flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 text-left text-sm font-medium transition-colors border-input bg-background text-foreground hover:bg-muted/50 cursor-pointer" aria-pressed="false"><span class="pr-5">Japanese / Sushi</span></button><button type="button" class="group relative flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 text-left text-sm font-medium transition-colors border-input bg-background text-foreground hover:bg-muted/50 cursor-pointer" aria-pressed="false"><span class="pr-5">Thai</span></button><button type="button" class="group relative flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 text-left text-sm font-medium transition-colors border-input bg-background text-foreground hover:bg-muted/50 cursor-pointer" aria-pressed="false"><span class="pr-5">Vietnamese</span></button><button type="button" class="group relative flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 text-left text-sm font-medium transition-colors border-input bg-background text-foreground hover:bg-muted/50 cursor-pointer" aria-pressed="false"><span class="pr-5">Korean</span></button><button type="button" class="group relative flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 text-left text-sm font-medium transition-colors border-input bg-background text-foreground hover:bg-muted/50 cursor-pointer" aria-pressed="false"><span class="pr-5">Indian</span></button><button type="button" class="group relative flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 text-left text-sm font-medium transition-colors border-input bg-background text-foreground hover:bg-muted/50 cursor-pointer" aria-pressed="false"><span class="pr-5">Mediterranean / Greek</span></button><button type="button" class="group relative flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 text-left text-sm font-medium transition-colors border-input bg-background text-foreground hover:bg-muted/50 cursor-pointer" aria-pressed="false"><span class="pr-5">Middle Eastern</span></button><button type="button" class="group relative flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 text-left text-sm font-medium transition-colors border-input bg-background text-foreground hover:bg-muted/50 cursor-pointer" aria-pressed="false"><span class="pr-5">French</span></button><button type="button" class="group relative flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 text-left text-sm font-medium transition-colors border-input bg-background text-foreground hover:bg-muted/50 cursor-pointer" aria-pressed="false"><span class="pr-5">Tex-Mex</span></button><button type="button" class="group relative flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 text-left text-sm font-medium transition-colors border-input bg-background text-foreground hover:bg-muted/50 cursor-pointer" aria-pressed="false"><span class="pr-5">Cajun / Creole</span></button><button type="button" class="group relative flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 text-left text-sm font-medium transition-colors border-input bg-background text-foreground hover:bg-muted/50 cursor-pointer" aria-pressed="false"><span class="pr-5">Pizza</span></button><button type="button" class="group relative flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 text-left text-sm font-medium transition-colors border-input bg-background text-foreground hover:bg-muted/50 cursor-pointer" aria-pressed="false"><span class="pr-5">Steakhouse</span></button><button type="button" class="group relative flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 text-left text-sm font-medium transition-colors border-input bg-background text-foreground hover:bg-muted/50 cursor-pointer" aria-pressed="false"><span class="pr-5">Seafood</span></button><button type="button" class="group relative flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 text-left text-sm font-medium transition-colors border-input bg-background text-foreground hover:bg-muted/50 cursor-pointer" aria-pressed="false"><span class="pr-5">Vegetarian-Forward</span></button><button type="button" class="group relative flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 text-left text-sm font-medium transition-colors border-input bg-background text-foreground hover:bg-muted/50 cursor-pointer" aria-pressed="false"><span class="pr-5">Cafe / Bakery</span></button><button type="button" class="group relative flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border px-3 py-2 text-left text-sm font-medium transition-colors border-input bg-background text-foreground hover:bg-muted/50 cursor-pointer" aria-pressed="false"><span class="pr-5">Tapas / Small Plates</span></button></div></section><div class="space-y-2"><label for="distance" class="text-sm font-medium">Distance preference</label><select id="distance" class="w-full rounded-md border border-input bg-background px-3 py-2.5 text-base sm:text-sm focus:border-ring focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring/20"><option value="5_mi">5 miles (Neighborhood)</option><option value="15_mi">15 miles (City)</option><option value="25_mi">25 miles (Metro)</option><option value="40_mi">40 miles (Road trip)</option></select></div><label class="flex cursor-pointer items-start gap-3 rounded-md border border-input px-3 py-3 hover:bg-muted/50"><input class="mt-1 size-4 shrink-0 rounded border-input" type="checkbox"><div><span class="text-sm font-medium">Interested in cocktail/bar experiences?</span><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground">If selected, we’ll include up to one curated cocktail experience per month (21+ required).</p></div></label><button type="submit" disabled="" class="inline-flex h-11 w-full items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-primary px-4 text-base font-semibold text-primary-foreground shadow-sm transition-opacity opacity-60">Continue</button></form><p class="wb-onboarding-aside">Already have an account? <a class="font-medium text-primary underline-offset-2 hover:underline" href="/signin">Sign in →</a></p></div></div></div></main>
