<main><header class="wb-onboarding-band"><div class="wb-onboarding-wrap"><p class="wb-onboarding-count" aria-live="polite">Step 3 of 3</p><h1>Your profile is saved</h1><p class="wb-onboarding-lede">Paid membership checkout is paused. We will not start Stripe from onboarding while checkout is frozen.</p><div class="wb-onboarding-steps"><div class="wb-onboarding-step"><div class="wb-onboarding-step-dot" data-state="complete"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></div><div class="wb-onboarding-step-line" data-complete="true" aria-hidden="true"></div><span class="wb-onboarding-step-label" data-state="complete">Preferences</span></div><div class="wb-onboarding-step"><div class="wb-onboarding-step-dot" data-state="complete"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></div><div class="wb-onboarding-step-line" data-complete="true" aria-hidden="true"></div><span class="wb-onboarding-step-label" data-state="complete">Profile</span></div><div class="wb-onboarding-step"><div class="wb-onboarding-step-dot" data-state="active" aria-current="step">3</div><span class="wb-onboarding-step-label" data-state="active">Plan</span></div></div></div></header><div class="wb-onboarding-sheet"><div class="wb-onboarding-body"><div class="wb-onboarding-card wb-onboarding-panel"><div data-slot="card" class="bg-card text-card-foreground flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-xl border py-6 shadow-[var(--shadow-violet)] wb-onboarding-plan"><div data-slot="card-header" class="@container/card-header grid auto-rows-min grid-rows-[auto_auto] items-start gap-2 px-6 has-data-[slot=card-action]:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] [.border-b]:pb-6 space-y-1 pb-2 text-center"><div data-slot="card-title" class="font-semibold text-xl sm:text-2xl">Wanderbite Club</div><div data-slot="card-description" class="text-muted-foreground text-base">One plan. Two adventures every month in McKinney, Texas.</div></div><div data-slot="card-content" class="px-6 space-y-5 pt-2"><div class="text-center"><p class="wb-onboarding-price">$15<span>/month</span></p><p class="wb-onboarding-note">Includes 2 curated adventures per month. Coming soon.</p></div><ul class="space-y-2.5"><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="mt-0.5 flex size-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/10 text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check size-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span><span>A discount on every assigned challenge</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="mt-0.5 flex size-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/10 text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check size-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span><span>Curated selection in McKinney, Texas</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="mt-0.5 flex size-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/10 text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check size-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span><span>Cancel anytime</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="mt-0.5 flex size-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary/10 text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check size-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span><span>1 Free Swap per month</span></li></ul><div class="wb-onboarding-fine"><p>Plan (when checkout reopens): $15/month (billed monthly). Auto-renews until canceled. Includes 2 challenges/month and 1 swap/month. Cancel anytime from your account; cancellation takes effect at the end of the billing period.</p><p>By creating an account, you agree to our <a class="underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-foreground" href="/terms">Terms</a>, <a class="underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-foreground" href="/privacy">Privacy</a>, and <a class="underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-foreground" href="/rules">Challenge rules</a>.</p></div><div class="wb-onboarding-attest"><form class="space-y-4"><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Terms and Privacy version 2026-02-22. This confirmation is saved only when you submit it.</p><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><input id="age-21-user-1" class="mt-1 size-4 shrink-0 rounded border-input" type="checkbox"><label for="age-21-user-1" class="text-sm leading-snug">I confirm I am 21 or older.</label></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><input id="terms-user-1" class="mt-1 size-4 shrink-0 rounded border-input" type="checkbox"><label for="terms-user-1" class="text-sm leading-snug text-muted-foreground">I agree to the <a class="font-medium text-primary underline-offset-2 hover:underline" href="/terms">Terms</a>, <a class="font-medium text-primary underline-offset-2 hover:underline" href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>, and <a class="font-medium text-primary underline-offset-2 hover:underline" href="/rules">Challenge rules</a>.</label></div><button data-slot="button" data-variant="default" data-size="default" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-full text-sm font-medium transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*='size-'])]:size-4 shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/90 hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:translate-y-0 h-9 px-4 py-2 has-[>svg]:px-3" type="submit">Confirm age and terms</button></form></div></div><div data-slot="card-footer" class="items-center px-6 [.border-t]:pt-6 flex flex-col gap-3 pt-2"><div role="status" class="w-full rounded-lg border border-border bg-muted/40 px-4 py-3 text-center"><p class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground">Launching soon</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Paid membership checkout is paused. We are not collecting emails or waitlist details yet.</p></div><p class="wb-onboarding-aside">Prefer to browse first? <a class="font-medium text-primary underline-offset-2 hover:underline" href="/pricing">View pricing</a></p><button type="button" class="wb-onboarding-back wb-onboarding-back-wide">← Back to profile</button></div></div></div></div></div></main>"
